      "value": "@{5a5988c8db2bba328bbed7b3|full_name}: I do use that to dance around the issue when trying to get from one gesture to the other, but it really seems like a workaround. It also increases the odds of accidentally firing other gestures. e.g., fist often somehow triggers when I'm not even hard-pressing the grip.",
