      "spam": false,
      "value": "I think it's triggered specifically by having your finger far from the controller's trigger; if you rest it there like you are with the rest of your fingers, you won't have that problem. Because the stick sensor is used for other gestures too, I think removing it would be pretty awful for using gestures while moving.",
